{"id":"n81623-1-12","stage":5,"title":"투정 · 缠磨","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81623-1-12-1","ko":"누가 이렇게 떼를 쓰는 거야?","zh":"是谁在这么撒泼呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"떼를","meaning":"耍赖，赖皮，纠缠","explanation":"떼：耍赖，赖皮，纠缠；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"떼","audio":"/audio/f447b643e59d2d414dc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54096","senseId":"1","lemma":"떼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떼를","audio":"/audio/fbd80f36617b29190324.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰는","meaning":"耍赖","explanation":"쓰다：耍赖；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"7","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰는","audio":"/audio/6f8201be65ab164072c8.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"f447b643e59d2d41","term":"떼","zh":"耍赖，赖皮，纠缠","audio":"/audio/f447b643e59d2d414dc6.mp3","entryId":"54096","definition":"固执地要求满足不合理的要求。","pronunciation":["떼"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"耍赖","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"强要某种不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/a388e4ad59b4658c1376.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81623-1-12-2","ko":"여동생이 입을 옷이 없다고 아빠에게 투정을 하는 소리야.","zh":"是妹妹说没有衣服穿，向爸爸诉苦的声音吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여동생이","meaning":"妹妹","explanation":"여동생：妹妹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여동생","audio":"/audio/3670c9dce0fb583071d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71002","senseId":"1","lemma":"여동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여동생이","audio":"/audio/5a84905dca10f3c5634d.mp3"}},{"text":"입을","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입을","audio":"/audio/90bdf6ff01ec6280bf14.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"없다고","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"899